T60	Cue 13968 13972	said
T61	Entity 13973 13976	she
T62	Quotation 14013 14240	"to have very good sense in a common way, like every body else, and if there is any thing to say, to sit down and write a letter, and say just what you must, in a short way; and another, to write verses and charades like this."
