T383	Entity 77268 77282	John Knightley
T384	Cue 77283 77293	began with
T385	Quotation 77296 77532	"I never in my life saw a man more intent on being agreeable than Mr. Elton.  It is downright labour to him where ladies are concerned.  With men he can be rational and unaffected, but when he has ladies to please, every feature works."
R518	Speaker Arg1:T383 Arg2:T385	
R519	Cueing Arg1:T384 Arg2:T385	
T386	Quotation 77533 77571	"Mr. Elton's manners are not perfect,"
T387	Cue 77572 77579	replied
T388	Entity 77580 77584	Emma
R520	Addressee Arg1:T388 Arg2:T385	
R521	Cueing Arg1:T387 Arg2:T386	
R522	Speaker Arg1:T388 Arg2:T386	
R523	Addressee Arg1:T383 Arg2:T386	
T389	Quotation 77586 77879	"but where there is a wish to please, one ought to overlook, and one does overlook a great deal.  Where a man does his best with only moderate powers, he will have the advantage over negligent superiority.  There is such perfect good-temper and good-will in Mr. Elton as one cannot but value."
R524	Cueing Arg1:T387 Arg2:T389	
R525	Speaker Arg1:T388 Arg2:T389	
T390	Entity 77892 77910	Mr. John Knightley
R526	Addressee Arg1:T390 Arg2:T389	
T391	Quotation 77880 77886	"Yes,"
T392	Cue 77887 77891	said
T393	Quotation 77941 77998	"he seems to have a great deal of good-will towards you."
R527	Cueing Arg1:T392 Arg2:T391	
R528	Speaker Arg1:T390 Arg2:T391	
R529	Addressee Arg1:T388 Arg2:T391	
R530	Cueing Arg1:T392 Arg2:T393	
R531	Speaker Arg1:T390 Arg2:T393	
