T672	Entity 155561 155562	I
T673	Entity 155568 155571	her
T674	Quotation 155573 155660	I am sure she would contrive to make it out herself, if she had nobody to do it for her
T675	Cue 155563 155567	tell
R866	Cueing Arg1:T670 Arg2:T671	
R867	Speaker Arg1:T669 Arg2:T671	
R868	Addressee Arg1:T672 Arg2:T671	
R869	Cueing Arg1:T675 Arg2:T674	
