T688	Quotation 156381 156591	"you who are such a judge, and write so beautifully yourself.  I am sure there is nobody's praise that could give us so much pleasure as Miss Woodhouse's. My mother does not hear; she is a little deaf you know.
R881	Cueing Arg1:T686 Arg2:T685	
R882	Speaker Arg1:T687 Arg2:T685	
