T746	Cue 182062 182066	said
T747	Entity 182067 182069	he
T748	Entity 182111 182114	her
T749	Quotation 182116 182192	"you are not going to tell me, I hope, that you had not a pleasant evening."
R966	Cueing Arg1:T746 Arg2:T745	
