R1030	Speaker Arg1:T781 Arg2:T796	
T797	Quotation 186899 187157	"Well! that is quite -- I suppose there never was a piece of news more generally interesting.  My dear sir, you really are too bountiful.  My mother desires her very best compliments and regards, and a thousand thanks, and says you really quite oppress her."
R1031	Speaker Arg1:T784 Arg2:T797	
R1032	Addressee Arg1:T781 Arg2:T797	
