R1038	Addressee Arg1:T784 Arg2:T801	
T802	Quotation 187334 187664	"Oh! my dear sir, as my mother says, our friends are only too good to us.  If ever there were people who, without having great wealth themselves, had every thing they could wish for, I am sure it is us. We may well say that 'our lot is cast in a goodly heritage.' Well, Mr. Knightley, and so you actually saw the letter; well -- "
