T831	Entity 190647 190651	Emma
T832	Cue 190652 190656	said
T833	Quotation 190658 190967	"You are silent, Miss Fairfax-- but I hope you mean to take an interest in this news.  You, who have been hearing and seeing so much of late on these subjects, who must have been so deep in the business on Miss Campbell's account-- we shall not excuse your being indifferent about Mr. Elton and Miss Hawkins."
R1086	Cueing Arg1:T832 Arg2:T833	
R1087	Speaker Arg1:T831 Arg2:T833	
